omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Bna-8SzCe6cQ7kNvwHCS8mB&_nc_oc=Adq3LvlV9Ltqly8HAWT67BNd_C22A2ja7CsS8_cdW6A-Y7aroBJt4U0WqvPa6ntV4PM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMCJU6tgpMtFr0IfgRc9PZ240iNNQMogZRzpzn-9-zJkg&oe=6AE21334"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=G-b7n1rWOJMQ7kNvwEXtT8T&_nc_oc=AdozJxCVypDoBlSBB8tuC8o7Xk8le84EgXNN2Jle6_dTMj3ThUBgkrTHILuSW3yyTwE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM1lynHXxNmZZ4e_5B1VonOdqCT8Cq87EfRitJmaI265A&oe=6AE21496"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=neae1mTkTFQQ7kNvwHcb0UL&_nc_oc=AdrYelu7XHfwAE_XfpyTuK9VDvY_QztzA6VKwj93Q6TK-d3ySjfXUcdsod_s36lzh18&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNziZJ63dRuQQz2GbhPLdXQxoxuHevnqIWq3Vxf060hVw&oe=6AE1F177"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://